{"duration_api_ms":7181,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"78c84082-74dd-4040-a223-5ac9b2baa5ba","total_cost_usd":0.017675,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":644,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":619,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":248},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":644,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":619,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":644,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":644},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":1210,"outputTokens":28,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.000135,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":619,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":644,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.01754,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":248,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":644,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**No.** Under the Irish Collective Asset-management Vehicles Act 2015, only the **ICAV itself** is a body corporate with legal personality. Its sub-funds are **not** separate legal persons.\n\n**How segregated liability fits in:**\n- The Act imposes **statutory segregated liability** between sub-funds. Each sub-fund's assets may only meet that sub-fund's liabilities and cannot be used to satisfy creditors of another sub-fund.\n- The ICAV contracts, sues and is sued **in respect of a specific sub-fund**. Set-off is permitted only within the same sub-fund.\n- Contracts are deemed to include implied terms that counterparties cannot claim against other sub-funds' assets.\n- Each sub-fund must keep separate books and records.\n\n**Practical caveat:** Segregation is a creature of Irish statute, not separate personality. Courts in other jurisdictions, for example where assets or counterparties are located, may not recognise it. Offering documents therefore typically disclose this as a risk.\n\nUmbrella Irish plcs have the same structure under the Companies Act 2014.","ttft_ms":3056,"type":"result","duration_ms":6686,"uuid":"f1e5b726-a75c-44ed-966b-d436709a0af7","ttft_stream_ms":520,"time_to_request_ms":63,"first_content_frame_ms":520,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
